WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless
chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 2

01:44.370 --> 01:46.600
These people are here to escort me to the capital city?

01:47.180 --> 01:48.730
Who asked them here?

01:49.050 --> 01:51.130
Your father, of course.

01:51.650 --> 01:53.450
I have refused him.

01:54.370 --> 01:56.770
The capital city is not a good place.

01:57.500 --> 01:59.410
Your mother died there.

02:00.860 --> 02:04.820
You can live longer if you stay here.

02:04.820 --> 02:07.130
But they are kneeling out of the door.

02:07.730 --> 02:09.280
Leave them alone.

02:10.340 --> 02:14.560
If they kneel there till they die, just bury them.

02:46.340 --> 02:47.610
Uncle,

02:48.010 --> 02:50.370
should I go to the capital city?

02:50.490 --> 02:52.490
I remember your mom doing business

02:52.490 --> 02:53.970
in the capital city back then.

02:54.700 --> 02:55.920
What else?

02:56.140 --> 02:57.530
I can't remember.

03:03.210 --> 03:04.680
So you mean

03:04.700 --> 03:06.170
I should go.

03:06.850 --> 03:09.760
To go or not to go, it's up to you.

03:14.260 --> 03:15.630
My mom was killed in the capital city.

03:15.650 --> 03:17.270
Are those killers still alive?

03:17.290 --> 03:18.640
I have no idea.

03:22.930 --> 03:24.690
I want to go to the capital city.

03:25.490 --> 03:27.890
What if it's dangerous?

03:28.900 --> 03:30.330
Whatever you like.

03:38.370 --> 03:39.640
What are you looking at?

03:40.700 --> 03:43.400
I've been wondering recently.

03:44.010 --> 03:46.530
Will your face remain young

03:46.620 --> 03:48.640
when I am in my seventies or eighties.

04:05.700 --> 04:07.040
Grandma!

04:08.260 --> 04:09.530
Madam!

04:10.900 --> 04:11.780
Those soldiers

04:11.780 --> 04:13.840
won't eat anything.

04:14.140 --> 04:16.910
I'm afraid if treated indifferently,
they won't remain loyal.

04:16.930 --> 04:17.580
Madam, I...

04:17.580 --> 04:19.010
Eat!

04:26.140 --> 04:27.690
I like this.

04:33.820 --> 04:35.640
Today's dish is so fresh! Where does it come from?

04:36.860 --> 04:38.410
He's asking you!

04:39.490 --> 04:41.520
Ha's nephew delivered it early in the morning.

04:41.540 --> 04:43.200
Isn't Ha the one who usually delivers the vegetables?

04:43.770 --> 04:45.570
How come his nephew came here today?

04:45.820 --> 04:47.740
Ha's sick, so his nephew took his place.

04:47.740 --> 04:48.750
Is there anything wrong?

04:48.770 --> 04:50.320
Has Ha's nephew been here before?

04:50.610 --> 04:52.570
It must be his first time.

04:52.700 --> 04:54.130
Anything wrong?

04:56.930 --> 04:58.090
Nothing.

05:02.090 --> 05:03.150
Grandma.

05:03.170 --> 05:05.160
I've finished eating. I'll leave now.

05:10.890 --> 05:13.310
Madam, forgive me for being outspoken.

05:13.330 --> 05:15.150
A dish of bamboo shoots counts for nothing.

05:15.170 --> 05:16.210
But he was acting

05:16.210 --> 05:18.920
so arrogantly.

05:22.050 --> 05:24.160
I'm just speaking out my mind.

05:36.050 --> 05:37.320
Young Master!

05:37.890 --> 05:38.910
Have you eaten the bamboo shoots?

05:38.930 --> 05:40.130
Yes.

05:40.580 --> 05:41.800
I...

05:41.820 --> 05:43.480
Young Master, you...

05:49.930 --> 05:51.960
Young Master, we don't know why.

05:51.980 --> 05:53.050
Everyone suddenly

05:53.050 --> 05:54.000
started vomiting and having watery stools.

05:54.020 --> 05:55.370
Come with me.

06:03.090 --> 06:04.410
Take this.

06:09.210 --> 06:10.440
Make them drink some milk.

06:10.460 --> 06:11.840
They'll be fine after vomiting.

06:11.860 --> 06:13.250
Here! Here! Here!

06:15.420 --> 06:16.910
Where are the men in red?

06:16.930 --> 06:18.460
They asked about Ha's residence.

06:18.460 --> 06:19.690
Then they left.

06:19.860 --> 06:21.150
Here! Here! Here! There! There!

06:21.170 --> 06:21.770
Here! Here! Here!

06:21.770 --> 06:23.640
Do make them drink more milk.

06:26.260 --> 06:27.530
Everyone drinks some.

06:31.740 --> 06:33.690
Here! Here! Here!

06:42.860 --> 06:44.200
Wait!

06:44.580 --> 06:45.850
What are you doing?

06:45.930 --> 06:47.860
Kill the one who poisoned the dish.

06:47.860 --> 06:49.630
Ha has delivered vegetables for us for many years.

06:49.650 --> 06:51.070
He must have been held hostage.

06:51.090 --> 06:52.120
If you rush in,

06:52.140 --> 06:53.280
he will be killed.

06:53.300 --> 06:54.520
Step aside!

06:54.540 --> 06:55.850
I'm Fan Xian.

06:56.020 --> 06:56.490
Step aside!

06:56.490 --> 06:58.290
What if it's a trick to lure you away?

06:59.860 --> 07:01.250
Leave it to me.

07:02.580 --> 07:03.880
Lend me a knife.

07:13.650 --> 07:14.850
Ha!

07:29.540 --> 07:32.060
You are the one who poisoned the bamboo shoots.

07:32.080 --> 07:34.150
=Teng Zijing, member of the Fourth Division
of the Investigator's Office of Nanqing=

07:35.740 --> 07:37.570
Holy crap! Doraemon!

08:51.050 --> 08:52.370
You lose!

08:52.410 --> 08:54.570
You've put poison on your dagger.

08:55.930 --> 08:58.130
Before you die, I have a question for you.

08:58.610 --> 08:59.260
Why didn't you

08:59.260 --> 09:00.810
let the soldiers in just now?

09:07.780 --> 09:09.600
Risking your life

09:09.820 --> 09:11.570
for a guy delivering vegetables,

09:12.050 --> 09:14.080
it's not worth it.

09:18.660 --> 09:20.000
What a coincidence!

09:20.020 --> 09:22.690
My knife is also coated with poison.

09:26.370 --> 09:27.710
Why are you fine with it?

09:27.730 --> 09:28.830
To tell you the truth,

09:28.850 --> 09:30.270
I've been poisoned since my childhood.

09:30.290 --> 09:31.140
For me, ordinary poison

09:31.140 --> 09:33.040
won't work.

09:34.260 --> 09:36.650
You're the one who poisoned the dish.

09:37.260 --> 09:38.890
Why didn't you use something highly toxic?

09:40.020 --> 09:41.720
I only need to kill you.

09:41.970 --> 09:43.240
Why do you have to kill me?

09:43.260 --> 09:46.840
I received a secret order
from the Investigator's Office to kill the traitor.

09:47.930 --> 09:50.130
You're from the Investigator's Office.

09:52.660 --> 09:53.350
If you kill me,

09:53.370 --> 09:54.390
another assassin will come.

09:54.410 --> 09:55.660
If the Investigator's Office wants to kill someone,

09:55.660 --> 09:56.890
he won't be able to...

10:00.170 --> 10:02.130
Token for Director-General of the Investigator's Office.

10:02.930 --> 10:04.210
Where did you get it?

10:04.660 --> 10:06.290
Fei Jie from the Third Division of the Investigator's Office

10:06.290 --> 10:07.810
is my teacher.

10:09.970 --> 10:11.280
You don't believe me?

10:12.260 --> 10:13.680
My mom died early.

10:13.700 --> 10:15.240
I own no place in the Fan mansion.

10:15.260 --> 10:16.340
I've lived in Danzhou since I was a child,

10:16.340 --> 10:18.150
but my dad never visited me.

10:18.170 --> 10:19.020
My point is

10:19.020 --> 10:20.220
how come a bastard son like me

10:20.220 --> 10:21.970
has the quality

10:21.970 --> 10:23.480
to become a traitor?

10:23.700 --> 10:25.080
Only because I'm handsome?

10:26.290 --> 10:28.120
You're a bastard?

10:28.140 --> 10:29.390
So think about it.

10:29.410 --> 10:30.410
I'm afraid there's something wrong with

10:30.410 --> 10:31.220
the secret order from the Investigator's Office.

10:31.220 --> 10:32.440
We can really talk about it.

10:32.460 --> 10:33.470
What do you think?

10:33.490 --> 10:34.440
Moreover,

10:34.460 --> 10:36.080
I also have a question for you.

10:36.100 --> 10:37.470
The Fan mansion is managed according to strict rules.

10:37.490 --> 10:38.610
How could you fool everyone

10:38.610 --> 10:40.140
by pretending to be Ha's nephew

10:40.140 --> 10:41.520
in you first appearance?

10:42.410 --> 10:44.250
Who covered for you?

10:57.960 --> 10:57.970
=Butler Zhou, butler of the Fan mansion in Danzhou=

10:57.970 --> 10:59.370
=Butler Zhou, butler of the Fan mansion in Danzhou=
You're the one who cooperated with the assassin

10:59.370 --> 10:59.440
=Butler Zhou, butler of the Fan mansion in Danzhou=
to mix the poison in the dish.

10:59.440 --> 11:00.800
to mix the poison in the dish.

11:00.820 --> 11:02.030
But it seems that

11:02.050 --> 11:03.290
grandma has already figured it out.

11:03.290 --> 11:05.430
=Madam Fan, Nanqing Earl Sinan Fan Jian's mother=

11:05.580 --> 11:06.760
Madam!

11:06.780 --> 11:07.700
Everything I did

11:07.700 --> 11:09.510
is for the Fan family.

11:09.530 --> 11:13.040
Take your time. Tell me everything.

11:14.020 --> 11:18.080
Xian'er, kneel down and listen.

11:21.730 --> 11:23.680
I was sent by Madam Liu Ruyu

11:23.700 --> 11:25.720
to keep an eye on Fan Xian.

11:26.610 --> 11:28.660
Once he arrives in the capital city,

11:28.660 --> 11:30.770
he is sure to scramble for family properties.

11:31.020 --> 11:32.710
Rather than let him ruin the family,

11:32.730 --> 11:33.730
it's better to make sure

11:33.730 --> 11:35.330
he never arrives in the capital city.

11:35.460 --> 11:36.140
Moreover,

11:36.140 --> 11:38.830
the Investigator's Office wanted to kill him this time.

11:38.850 --> 11:39.780
I was just

11:39.780 --> 11:41.480
giving them a hand.

11:45.900 --> 11:47.370
That's right.

11:49.850 --> 11:54.330
To protect the Fan family, we can't be softhearted.

12:09.340 --> 12:14.450
Xian'er, you must keep that in mind.

12:14.970 --> 12:16.600
You've grown up.

12:16.900 --> 12:19.810
You must learn to be merciless.

12:20.660 --> 12:22.450
I see.

12:24.820 --> 12:26.370
Guards!

12:28.820 --> 12:30.480
Madam!

12:31.170 --> 12:32.590
Break his legs!

12:32.610 --> 12:34.250
Throw him onto a fish boat!

12:34.410 --> 12:37.390
He doesn't have to land the rest of his life.

12:37.410 --> 12:38.650
Yes.

12:39.580 --> 12:44.480
No! No! No!

12:46.930 --> 12:48.820
No! No! No!

12:48.820 --> 12:50.160
Madam!

12:50.220 --> 12:53.210
You've never liked Fan Xian
the whole time, haven't you?

12:54.290 --> 12:56.520
It's all an act!

12:57.170 --> 12:59.570
An act!

13:04.730 --> 13:07.160
He had received a letter from Liu Ruyu,

13:07.780 --> 13:09.470
asking him to cooperate with others

13:09.490 --> 13:11.370
to kill you.

13:11.970 --> 13:13.690
What do you think?

13:17.290 --> 13:18.610
Madam Liu Ruyu

13:18.610 --> 13:20.390
sends me gifts on every festival.

13:20.410 --> 13:21.470
She's very kind to me.

13:21.490 --> 13:22.960
I do remember that.

13:24.490 --> 13:29.370
Right. A letter alone can't prove her guilty.

13:29.490 --> 13:31.080
I'll ask your father

13:31.100 --> 13:32.810
to investigate it further.

13:33.100 --> 13:35.080
There must be an outcome.

13:35.100 --> 13:36.920
Grandma!

13:37.100 --> 13:40.520
What if I investigate it myself?

13:41.460 --> 13:43.570
You want to go to the capital city?

13:45.780 --> 13:47.080
Haven't we agreed that

13:47.100 --> 13:48.910
you stay in Danzhou?

13:48.930 --> 13:52.130
I'll persuade your father.

13:52.170 --> 13:53.200
Grandma!

13:53.220 --> 13:55.040
Look what a big man I've grown into.

13:55.820 --> 13:58.250
I have to witness the big world.

14:03.370 --> 14:05.400
The first assassin has come,

14:05.820 --> 14:07.570
and a second one will follow.

14:08.660 --> 14:10.810
I've hidden for so long,

14:10.900 --> 14:12.720
but they still won't let me go.

14:13.170 --> 14:15.210
I might as well face them directly.

14:26.560 --> 14:28.310
Have you made up your mind?

14:31.280 --> 14:33.910
I'll come back after solving everything.

14:34.400 --> 14:37.070
What if Liu Ruyu is behind the assassin?

14:42.040 --> 14:45.350
Then I'll tell her that

14:45.840 --> 14:47.630
I'm not interested in the family properties.

14:48.720 --> 14:51.070
I just taught you

14:51.160 --> 14:53.670
to be merciless.

14:54.880 --> 14:57.510
Just be cautious!

14:58.320 --> 15:00.910
Rest assured. I'm smart and flexible.

15:02.840 --> 15:04.260
When will you leave?

15:04.280 --> 15:05.710
Tomorrow.

15:18.560 --> 15:19.990
Well,

15:21.360 --> 15:23.630
I won't see you off tomorrow.

15:25.360 --> 15:29.230
I'm too old to stand separation.

15:34.160 --> 15:36.310
Go back and get prepared.

15:51.840 --> 15:53.940
Your grandma is really merciless.

15:53.960 --> 15:56.150
She won't let him land the rest of his life.

15:58.480 --> 15:59.760
I've heard that

15:59.760 --> 16:01.460
you two don't get along. Is that true?

16:01.480 --> 16:03.300
I've been hunted down by assassins since childhood,

16:03.320 --> 16:05.230
so I was always worried that
I might bring trouble to my family.

16:05.600 --> 16:06.600
So you asked her

16:06.600 --> 16:08.630
to treat you indifferently.

16:08.760 --> 16:10.830
But actually you were protecting her, right?

16:11.040 --> 16:13.070
Now I'm leaving.

16:14.120 --> 16:15.750
There's no need to act any more.

16:16.320 --> 16:17.660
Thank you for helping me

16:17.680 --> 16:18.640
in the cooperation.

16:18.640 --> 16:19.660
No need to thank me.

16:19.680 --> 16:21.760
The Investigator's Office has sent
an urgent order via a flying pigeon,

16:21.760 --> 16:24.100
saying that the secret order to kill you is fake.

16:24.120 --> 16:26.220
Someone wanted to get rid of you

16:26.240 --> 16:27.700
by using the Investigator's Office.

16:27.720 --> 16:28.870
Who?

16:28.960 --> 16:30.190
We're still investigating.

16:33.120 --> 16:34.460
When I arrive in the capital city,

16:34.480 --> 16:36.150
I can figure it out for sure.

16:39.440 --> 16:42.140
Fan Xian, I need a favor from you.

16:42.160 --> 16:43.140
Just say it.

16:43.160 --> 16:44.870
Please kill me.

16:47.560 --> 16:48.540
Pardon?

16:48.560 --> 16:51.390
Please kill me.

16:55.160 --> 16:56.740
What's your name?

16:56.760 --> 17:00.150
Teng Zijing from the Fourth Division
of the Investigator's Office.

17:05.320 --> 17:07.060
Boss, I'd like to buy a pair of scissors.

17:07.080 --> 17:08.750
Here is the money.

17:17.200 --> 17:18.950
I'll take the scissors.

17:29.410 --> 17:31.250
He stole a lot of things.

17:31.820 --> 17:33.200
I know.

17:35.220 --> 17:36.460
Because it doesn't matter

17:36.460 --> 17:37.720
whether the shop makes a profit or not.

17:38.130 --> 17:40.530
You're here to protect me.

17:40.980 --> 17:42.200
Yes.

17:52.100 --> 17:55.960
Uncle, I'm leaving for the capital city.

17:58.460 --> 17:59.890
OK.

18:03.250 --> 18:06.290
I didn't tell you about the assassination this time.

18:07.860 --> 18:10.170
Do you know why I keep it from you?

18:10.930 --> 18:12.320
I don't.

18:12.410 --> 18:14.050
Because I want to show you

18:14.170 --> 18:15.680
I can live well

18:16.500 --> 18:17.530
in this world

18:17.530 --> 18:19.370
without your help.

18:20.170 --> 18:21.510
I've already grown up.

18:21.530 --> 18:22.680
Good.

18:27.890 --> 18:29.770
Ever since I could remember,

18:30.100 --> 18:31.800
you've been guarding me.

18:32.100 --> 18:33.050
As long as you're around,

18:33.050 --> 18:34.800
I fear nothing.

18:38.650 --> 18:40.200
But that is not right.

18:42.700 --> 18:44.560
What is not right?

18:45.980 --> 18:48.200
Liu from the kitchen likes fishing.

18:48.340 --> 18:51.370
Ma who guards the door loves watching girls.

18:51.410 --> 18:53.480
Everyone has a hobby.

18:55.740 --> 18:58.720
And you? What do you like?

18:59.340 --> 19:00.720
Nothing.

19:03.050 --> 19:04.750
Then do you have someone you like?

19:04.770 --> 19:07.530
Something you want to do?
Your own plan for life?

19:13.500 --> 19:14.960
Sometimes, I just feel that

19:14.980 --> 19:17.130
you are living for me.

19:18.290 --> 19:19.930
That's not fair to you.

19:33.500 --> 19:35.560
You don't need me anymore?

19:36.340 --> 19:37.930
I will always need you.

19:39.050 --> 19:40.370
But Uncle,

19:41.220 --> 19:43.080
to me,

19:43.250 --> 19:45.530
you're more than a guardian angel.

19:46.620 --> 19:47.890
You're also the most important family member

19:47.890 --> 19:49.370
I've left in the world.

19:50.500 --> 19:51.510
I hope you can find something

19:51.530 --> 19:53.250
you want to do.

19:55.410 --> 19:57.320
Do you understand what I'm talking about?

20:02.380 --> 20:04.080
Not really.

20:06.410 --> 20:07.680
Uncle.

20:08.930 --> 20:10.930
I'm leaving for the capital city tomorrow.

20:12.290 --> 20:14.600
I will find those who want to kill me,

20:14.650 --> 20:16.650
and I will explore my mom's stories.

20:17.820 --> 20:18.700
I will live my life

20:18.700 --> 20:20.250
better than anyone else in the world,

20:21.050 --> 20:23.200
because that's what I want all along.

20:23.820 --> 20:25.170
That's terrific.

20:26.460 --> 20:27.580
I hope you can find something

20:27.580 --> 20:29.440
you want to do.

20:30.170 --> 20:31.770
Live for yourself.

21:03.410 --> 21:05.720
Find something I want to do.

21:07.170 --> 21:09.320
Live for myself.

21:11.650 --> 21:13.800
Find something I want to do.

21:16.380 --> 21:18.410
Live for myself.

21:30.100 --> 21:30.770
Uncle Wuzhu,

21:30.770 --> 21:31.340
can you show up

21:31.340 --> 21:32.840
normally?

21:32.860 --> 21:34.290
I remember.

21:37.340 --> 21:38.680
Remember what?

21:38.700 --> 21:40.110
Miss once said the same words

21:40.130 --> 21:41.840
as you did this afternoon.

21:41.860 --> 21:42.820
She wanted me

21:42.820 --> 21:44.150
to find something I like.

21:44.170 --> 21:45.440
Then have you found it?

21:47.100 --> 21:48.530
I want to open it.

22:02.650 --> 22:04.680
It was left by miss back then.

22:04.770 --> 22:06.130
It's from my mother?

22:06.930 --> 22:08.080
What's in it?

22:08.100 --> 22:09.320
I don't know.

22:09.580 --> 22:11.110
You never opened it?

22:11.130 --> 22:12.910
She never told me to open it.

22:12.930 --> 22:13.870
What now?

22:13.890 --> 22:15.200
I've thought for a long time.

22:16.050 --> 22:17.110
In this world,

22:17.130 --> 22:18.560
what I want to do most

22:18.580 --> 22:20.320
is to open this box.

22:20.410 --> 22:21.410
I want to see

22:21.410 --> 22:23.050
what on earth did Miss leave.

22:23.530 --> 22:26.530
You must have been through a lot.

22:27.890 --> 22:29.200
I've forgotten.

22:30.530 --> 22:33.150
Come on! Let's open it.

22:33.170 --> 22:34.440
I don't have the key.

22:35.890 --> 22:37.200
Wait a minute.

22:45.460 --> 22:47.650
Wait a minute. I'll go fetch another knife.

23:01.890 --> 23:04.370
It's way too tough.

23:05.500 --> 23:07.360
What's it made of?

23:07.380 --> 23:08.650
I don't know.

23:09.220 --> 23:11.680
How come it's so tough?

23:11.700 --> 23:13.680
Where did my mom get it?

23:14.100 --> 23:15.410
I've forgotten.

23:15.740 --> 23:17.080
Where is the key?

23:17.380 --> 23:18.650
In the capital city.

23:19.050 --> 23:20.930
So, I will also go to the capital city.

23:21.820 --> 23:23.170
Let's leave together tomorrow.

23:24.130 --> 23:27.250
I'll leave first. Let's meet in the capital city.

23:28.130 --> 23:29.200
What about this box?

23:29.220 --> 23:30.530
You keep it.

23:33.100 --> 23:35.530
What's it really made of?

23:58.460 --> 23:59.770
Girl.

23:59.980 --> 24:00.990
Madam!

24:01.010 --> 24:03.750
Is Young Master gone by now?

24:03.770 --> 24:05.770
Let's go and have a look.

24:05.860 --> 24:07.170
No need.

24:07.650 --> 24:08.960
Yes.

24:21.220 --> 24:23.770
He knows what he wants.

24:25.380 --> 24:27.480
He'll leave eventually.

24:30.580 --> 24:31.890
Young Master!

24:49.740 --> 24:53.410
I've told you I won't see you off.

24:54.620 --> 24:55.910
You...

24:55.930 --> 24:57.890
It's not proper!

24:57.890 --> 24:58.960
Take care.

24:58.980 --> 25:00.250
When I figure everything out,

25:00.250 --> 25:01.720
I will come back to pick you up.

26:10.770 --> 26:11.410
Young Master.

26:11.410 --> 26:13.360
The water is being heated.
It's gonna take a while before eating.

26:13.380 --> 26:14.560
That's fine. Go ahead and do your business.

26:14.580 --> 26:15.990
I'm just walking around for a stretch.

26:16.010 --> 26:17.200
Yes!

26:18.530 --> 26:19.720
Young Master!

26:22.290 --> 26:23.600
Young Master!

26:29.460 --> 26:30.680
Young Master!

26:40.460 --> 26:41.130
Teng...

26:41.130 --> 26:42.440
Young Master, what's wrong?

26:42.460 --> 26:43.680
Nothing.

26:48.650 --> 26:49.800
Well,

26:50.410 --> 26:52.170
why are you here?

26:52.890 --> 26:54.390
I also need to return to the capital city.

26:54.410 --> 26:55.620
Didn't you ask me to spread the word that

26:55.620 --> 26:57.250
you're dead?

26:57.650 --> 26:58.840
Right.

26:59.010 --> 27:01.080
Officially, I was killed by you.

27:01.100 --> 27:02.600
I can't show my face in public.

27:02.620 --> 27:03.840
So I follow you cavalry

27:04.290 --> 27:07.170
to avoid examination.

27:08.010 --> 27:09.630
My guards know you?

27:09.650 --> 27:10.840
No, they don't.

27:10.860 --> 27:12.390
But they know what silver is.

27:12.410 --> 27:13.890
Why do you go to the capital city?

27:14.010 --> 27:15.370
It's none of your business.

27:15.890 --> 27:17.320
Fine with me.

27:18.620 --> 27:19.990
I go to the capital city this time

27:20.010 --> 27:22.480
to find out who really wants to kill me.

27:22.740 --> 27:23.650
It's Liu Ruyu, isn't it?

27:23.650 --> 27:24.910
The second wife of your father?

27:24.930 --> 27:26.480
I want to know how she

27:26.500 --> 27:27.630
misled the Investigator's Office.

27:27.650 --> 27:28.960
I don't know that.

27:30.250 --> 27:31.800
You can help me find out.

27:32.130 --> 27:33.840
When arriving in the capital city,
we can cooperate with each other.

27:33.860 --> 27:36.130
Your death is the best cover.

27:36.250 --> 27:38.010
Why should I help you?

27:38.460 --> 27:41.080
Don't you want to know who tricked you?

27:41.340 --> 27:42.930
No, I don't.

27:43.220 --> 27:45.750
Now, you're asking me for a favor.

27:45.770 --> 27:47.010
Well then,

27:47.130 --> 27:48.480
I'll consider it when I reach the capital city.

27:48.500 --> 27:49.930
Come back!

27:50.170 --> 27:51.380
Do you think

27:51.380 --> 27:52.460
you are serious enough?

27:52.460 --> 27:54.620
You have to prepare for your marriage
when you arrive in the capital city.

27:54.620 --> 27:56.560
You won't have time for the investigation.

27:56.580 --> 27:57.800
What marriage?

27:58.170 --> 27:59.980
Aren't you going to the capital city for getting married?

27:59.980 --> 28:01.410
No one told you that?

28:02.820 --> 28:04.480
No one did.

28:04.890 --> 28:07.050
How did you know?

28:07.410 --> 28:09.380
After receiving the secret order of killing you,

28:09.380 --> 28:10.580
I have to know your information.

28:10.580 --> 28:11.600
Just a quick glance.

28:11.620 --> 28:12.580
Then whom am I going to marry?

28:12.580 --> 28:13.630
I don't know.

28:13.650 --> 28:14.890
I was ordered to kill you,

28:14.890 --> 28:15.820
not your whole family.

28:15.820 --> 28:17.410
Why should I learn so much about you?

28:22.650 --> 28:23.930
This

28:24.410 --> 28:25.870
is my gift for your marriage.

28:25.890 --> 28:28.600
Wish you a long and harmonious union,
and may you have a baby soon.

28:28.740 --> 28:30.290
I'm going to make a fire.

28:51.290 --> 28:52.530
What are you doing?

28:53.580 --> 28:56.170
The trade caravan coming toward us
belongs to the Investigator's Office.

29:11.040 --> 29:13.390
=Fei Jie, director of the Third Division
of the Investigator's Office=

29:18.930 --> 29:20.320
Luckily, I have sharp eyes.

29:20.340 --> 29:21.740
Most men in that trade caravan

29:21.740 --> 29:23.290
are from the Fourth Division.

29:24.380 --> 29:25.600
Moreover,

29:25.620 --> 29:26.770
powerful as your teacher,

29:26.770 --> 29:28.480
he actually travels along to keep up the formation.

29:28.650 --> 29:30.130
I'm afraid something serious is happening.

29:31.650 --> 29:33.010
Stop!

29:33.620 --> 29:34.890
What are you doing?

29:41.340 --> 29:42.410
Master Fei, we've checked.

29:42.410 --> 29:43.560
The inn is safe.

29:43.580 --> 29:45.010
Good. Then we'll rest here.

29:45.010 --> 29:46.200
Yes.

29:50.930 --> 29:52.340
I will walk around

29:52.340 --> 29:53.630
to see if there's anything strange.

29:53.650 --> 29:55.080
OK.

30:04.740 --> 30:06.840
I know you'll follow me.

30:09.740 --> 30:10.800
Where did you get this?

30:10.820 --> 30:13.050
I took it from a fruit ranch nearby.

30:16.220 --> 30:17.990
Where are you going?

30:18.010 --> 30:18.840
Beiqi.

30:18.860 --> 30:20.080
Beiqi?

30:20.100 --> 30:22.010
Don't they always want to go to war with us?

30:22.010 --> 30:23.560
The war is coming.

30:24.010 --> 30:25.220
The Investigator's Office established
an intelligence network

30:25.220 --> 30:26.620
in Beiqi years ago.

30:26.620 --> 30:28.840
The performance was bad. They need a head.

30:28.860 --> 30:30.080
So they send you there?

30:30.130 --> 30:32.890
Me? I'm only good at poisoning others.

30:33.700 --> 30:35.010
I'm seeing someone off.

30:36.220 --> 30:37.510
The one sitting in the carriage?

30:37.530 --> 30:38.770
Yes.

30:38.860 --> 30:40.100
It's Yan Ruohai's son,

30:40.100 --> 30:41.320
Yan Bingyun.

30:41.620 --> 30:43.130
Really a promising young man.

30:43.220 --> 30:45.770
How can you send such an excellent
young man to an enemy country?

30:46.530 --> 30:47.870
It's all because of you.

30:47.890 --> 30:49.250
Because of me?

30:49.770 --> 30:52.680
That Teng Zijing you killed is a scout of the Fourth Division.

30:53.290 --> 30:56.600
A member of the Fourth Division
actually tried to kill his superior.

30:56.620 --> 30:59.480
Yan Ruohai must take the responsibility.

30:59.500 --> 31:00.510
Teng Zijing

31:00.530 --> 31:03.250
is under the command of his son Yan Bingyun.

31:03.250 --> 31:06.290
The Head was so angry that
he dismissed him from his post,

31:06.980 --> 31:09.650
asking him to disguise with his men as trade caravan

31:09.650 --> 31:12.440
to take over the intelligence network in Beiqi.

31:12.500 --> 31:13.770
It's pretty serious.

31:13.890 --> 31:16.770
I'm kind of seeing him off,
and kind of keeping up the formation.

31:17.460 --> 31:20.650
I killed a member of our division. Am I in trouble?

31:20.980 --> 31:23.440
Teng Zijing is not a regular member of the Investigator's Office.

31:23.460 --> 31:24.560
He is relatively new to our office.

31:24.580 --> 31:25.840
So it's no big deal.

31:25.860 --> 31:28.320
But you were lucky this time.

31:28.530 --> 31:29.600
What do you mean?

31:29.620 --> 31:32.650
The Fourth Division is in charge of detection and patrol.

31:32.890 --> 31:34.750
The Sixth Division is the division responsible for assassination.

31:34.770 --> 31:37.080
Whoever wants to kill you didn't try hard enough.

31:37.100 --> 31:39.110
The fake order wasn't given to the Sixth Division,

31:39.130 --> 31:41.050
so the scout of the Fourth Division took action.

31:41.050 --> 31:42.440
If someone from the Sixth Division took the order,

31:42.460 --> 31:43.800
then you were in real trouble.

31:45.460 --> 31:47.800
I didn't know there are so many stories behind.

31:48.460 --> 31:52.080
Well, you should go back.

31:52.100 --> 31:53.720
And listen,

31:53.930 --> 31:57.170
no matter what happens, just wait till I'm back.

31:57.340 --> 31:58.420
Also,

31:58.580 --> 32:00.370
next time you take pears,

32:00.500 --> 32:03.110
do pick those big, fatty ones.

32:03.130 --> 32:05.560
Those are much sweeter.

32:26.130 --> 32:27.480
Fan Xian.

32:28.580 --> 32:30.050
Yan Bingyun.

32:36.050 --> 32:37.290
Do you stop me

32:37.290 --> 32:39.530
to avenge Teng Zijing's death?

32:39.740 --> 32:41.770
Teng Zijing didn't deserve to die.

32:42.740 --> 32:45.130
I already killed him. What do you want?

32:45.130 --> 32:47.080
Give me the token for Director-General.

32:50.410 --> 32:52.410
So you want to take it by force?

32:55.620 --> 32:57.010
Give it to me!

32:59.860 --> 33:00.750
Come on!

33:00.770 --> 33:02.290
Yan Bingyun.

33:03.860 --> 33:05.960
You should remember the order you've taken.

33:05.980 --> 33:07.770
You can't get off the carriage

33:07.860 --> 33:10.680
before arriving in Beiqi.

33:10.770 --> 33:13.910
Fan Xian is cruel and mischievous.

33:13.930 --> 33:15.800
If he keeps the token,

33:15.820 --> 33:18.680
the Investigator's Office
as well as Nanqing will be in danger.

33:18.700 --> 33:21.080
If you get off this carriage,

33:22.220 --> 33:25.410
our undercover operation in Beiqi will be ruined.

33:25.930 --> 33:27.600
By then,

33:27.980 --> 33:29.600
you will be the one

33:29.620 --> 33:32.030
who puts Nanqing in danger.

33:32.050 --> 33:33.390
I won't get off the carriage.

33:33.410 --> 33:35.530
You guys! Take his token for me.

33:35.620 --> 33:39.410
Whoever moves will be killed immediately.

33:46.130 --> 33:47.530
Let's go back.

33:52.890 --> 33:54.200
That's right.

33:54.340 --> 33:55.770
Go back and rest.

33:55.770 --> 33:57.230
We still have a long way to go tomorrow.

33:57.250 --> 34:00.930
Fan Xian, we'll meet again.

34:01.220 --> 34:03.770
He won't be back for a minute.

34:34.180 --> 34:35.490
Wait a moment!

34:38.860 --> 34:40.410
Mr. Fan!

34:40.730 --> 34:40.920
It's a long way from Danzhou to the capital city.

34:40.920 --> 34:42.820
=Wang Qinian, clerk of the Investigator's Office of Nanqing=
It's a long way from Danzhou to the capital city.

34:42.820 --> 34:43.230
=Wang Qinian, clerk of the Investigator's Office of Nanqing=

34:43.250 --> 34:45.000
You must be tired.

34:45.940 --> 34:47.370
Do I know you?

34:48.420 --> 34:51.320
I've admired you for a long time.

34:51.340 --> 34:53.320
It's a pity that I never got the chance to meet you.

34:53.340 --> 34:56.800
Today we finally meet. I feel so honored.

34:56.820 --> 34:58.580
Fine. Let's find a place to talk

34:58.580 --> 34:59.470
some other day.

34:59.490 --> 35:00.970
I'm not available today. I need to get back at once.

35:00.970 --> 35:01.710
See you.

35:01.730 --> 35:03.040
Wait a moment.

35:09.100 --> 35:10.510
You want to check me?

35:10.530 --> 35:11.800
Of course not.

35:11.820 --> 35:15.840
I have something to show you.

35:23.380 --> 35:25.030
This map

35:25.050 --> 35:28.000
illustrates the scenic spots of the capital city in detail.

35:28.180 --> 35:30.230
You are here for the first time.

35:30.250 --> 35:31.890
It might be useful.

35:36.490 --> 35:37.800
Thank you!

35:39.450 --> 35:43.080
Two taels of silver will be enough.

35:43.100 --> 35:44.930
Two taels?

35:45.420 --> 35:46.250
This map

35:46.250 --> 35:48.000
is made of fine paper

35:48.290 --> 35:49.940
and drawn with fine brush and imperial ink.

35:49.940 --> 35:51.860
I worked my heart out

35:51.860 --> 35:52.940
to paint it myself

35:52.940 --> 35:54.490
after carrying out repeated surveys and explorations.

35:54.490 --> 35:55.470
Besides,

35:55.490 --> 35:58.030
it's the last one left.

35:58.050 --> 35:59.710
Only two taels of silver.

35:59.730 --> 36:02.860
It won't even cover

36:02.860 --> 36:05.080
the trips I've taken and the tea I've had.

36:10.290 --> 36:12.450
Two taels of silver! Here you are!

36:15.490 --> 36:16.840
Let's go!

36:24.210 --> 36:26.080
It's more than two taels!

36:38.250 --> 36:39.120
Everyone,

36:39.140 --> 36:41.650
see you later.

36:41.730 --> 36:43.000
Wang,

36:43.530 --> 36:46.210
how many of your crappy maps have you sold?

36:46.770 --> 36:49.010
Almost every young man from official families

36:49.010 --> 36:50.930
who came a long way to the capital city has bought my map.

36:52.010 --> 36:53.600
Aren't you afraid of being beaten up?

36:54.580 --> 36:57.320
For those who are from big families, two taels of silver

36:57.340 --> 36:58.970
are no big deal.

36:59.010 --> 37:00.160
Moreover,

37:00.180 --> 37:01.420
there're so many cunning foxes

37:01.420 --> 37:03.450
in the capital city.

37:03.450 --> 37:06.410
I'm also helping them grow up faster.

37:06.770 --> 37:08.130
Thank you! Thank you!

37:14.100 --> 37:15.490
Why not tear it up?

37:16.860 --> 37:18.650
It's two taels of silver after all.

37:21.620 --> 37:23.010
Walk along this road,

37:23.010 --> 37:23.860
and you'll see the Fan mansion.

37:23.860 --> 37:26.840
Let's part here.

37:26.860 --> 37:27.990
Are you leaving?

37:28.010 --> 37:29.340
I've told you. When I arrive in the capital city,

37:29.340 --> 37:31.120
I've something personal to deal with.

37:31.140 --> 37:32.690
Thanks for taking me in.

37:33.010 --> 37:34.730
We'll probably never see each other again.

37:34.730 --> 37:35.840
Come to me if you need anything.

37:35.860 --> 37:37.450
I might be able to help.

37:38.250 --> 37:39.920
You are probably unable to protect yourself.

37:39.940 --> 37:41.730
If Liu Ruyu really wants to kill you,

37:41.730 --> 37:42.580
I'm afraid it won't be easy for you

37:42.580 --> 37:44.240
to enter the Fan mansion.

37:46.490 --> 37:47.430
Please don't die.

37:47.450 --> 37:49.370
Even if you die, I won't avenge on your death.

37:54.860 --> 37:56.840
Thanks for your blessings.

38:00.580 --> 38:02.520
Let's see how you are gonna kill me.

38:26.820 --> 38:27.530
Right after the red flags pass,

38:27.530 --> 38:28.750
we jump on that carriage.

38:28.770 --> 38:29.340
Do you understand?

38:29.340 --> 38:30.650
Yes!

39:07.660 --> 39:09.190
The guards are needed elsewhere.

39:09.210 --> 39:11.760
I'll escort you back home.

39:46.450 --> 39:47.750
I was just told that

39:47.770 --> 39:49.710
I can reach the Fan mansion by going straight.

39:49.730 --> 39:51.040
Why do you make a turn?

39:51.290 --> 39:54.930
A carriage turned over in front.
We have to make a detour.

39:56.250 --> 39:57.730
What a coincidence!

40:04.290 --> 40:05.620
Young Master, I need to answer the call of nature.

40:05.620 --> 40:07.560
Please wait a moment.

41:00.940 --> 41:02.880
What is this temple?

41:02.900 --> 41:04.320
Get out!

41:20.730 --> 41:22.210
Having overbearing vitality Qi

41:22.290 --> 41:23.920
at such a young age,

41:23.940 --> 41:26.130
who are you?

41:26.180 --> 41:28.640
You don't know who I am?

41:28.660 --> 41:30.210
I really don't care.

41:30.340 --> 41:32.990
Someone important is praying in the divine temple.

41:33.010 --> 41:36.170
No one shall enter.

41:40.770 --> 41:44.690
So I'm not expected.

41:58.620 --> 42:00.280
The man inside the divine temple said

42:00.730 --> 42:02.750
all citizens of Nanqing can worship in the temple.

42:02.770 --> 42:03.990
You can go inside.

42:04.010 --> 42:06.190
But you can only enter the side palace hall,

42:06.210 --> 42:07.930
not the main hall.

42:08.340 --> 42:09.800
What if I don't go inside?

42:09.820 --> 42:12.970
Then just leave. Cut the crap.

42:29.180 --> 42:30.970
What does the temple worship?

42:31.050 --> 42:34.170
Any temple for worshipping is a divine temple.

42:34.450 --> 42:36.210
How could you not know that?

42:37.450 --> 42:38.890
Divine temple?

42:39.730 --> 42:42.370
When heaven was separated from earth,
giant monsters ran wild.

42:42.450 --> 42:44.710
Master from the divine temple
came to earth with dignity and virtue,

42:44.730 --> 42:46.100
teaching mankind characters and etiquette

42:46.100 --> 42:47.750
and helping mankind cutting mountains and making seas,

42:47.770 --> 42:49.760
thus laying foundation for the human race.

42:50.290 --> 42:52.240
Haven't you learned that from your parents?

42:55.010 --> 42:56.970
Mythology.

43:04.180 --> 43:06.040
You really don't know who I am?

43:29.200 --> 43:32.780
In the river of history,

43:32.800 --> 43:36.270
time goes round and round.

43:39.080 --> 43:42.420
Memories about the former and present lives

43:42.440 --> 43:46.510
join each other in an endless way.

43:48.400 --> 43:51.020
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:51.040 --> 43:53.280
one season follows another in a flash,

43:53.280 --> 43:55.780
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:55.800 --> 43:57.400
I just can't give up

43:57.400 --> 44:00.740
to be with you for my whole life.

44:00.760 --> 44:06.230
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

44:07.480 --> 44:10.030
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

44:10.320 --> 44:12.360
Year after year in the wandering,

44:12.360 --> 44:15.020
I count the remaining years.

44:15.040 --> 44:17.220
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:17.240 --> 44:19.230
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:19.520 --> 44:21.910
I never feel regretful.

44:21.960 --> 44:23.320
In such a chaotic world,

44:23.320 --> 44:26.300
I still miss you as ever.

44:26.320 --> 44:29.270
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:29.560 --> 44:31.620
With a gentle heart,

44:31.640 --> 44:34.300
I cherish our remaining years.

44:34.320 --> 44:35.840
Even though we have to go through

44:35.840 --> 44:38.350
all the hardships along the journey,

44:38.480 --> 44:45.670
you always stay by my side,

44:45.760 --> 44:48.430
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:48.720 --> 44:50.800
Year after year in the wandering,

44:50.800 --> 44:53.460
I count the remaining years.

44:53.480 --> 44:55.620
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:55.640 --> 44:57.870
even though we end up the destiny,

44:58.080 --> 45:00.260
I never feel regretful.

45:00.280 --> 45:01.680
In such a chaotic world,

45:01.680 --> 45:04.740
I still miss you as ever.

45:04.760 --> 45:07.870
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

45:07.960 --> 45:10.100
With a gentle heart,

45:10.120 --> 45:12.820
I cherish our remaining years.

45:12.840 --> 45:14.280
Even though we have to go through

45:14.280 --> 45:16.940
all the hardships along the journey,

45:16.960 --> 45:25.720
you always stay by my side...
